      "text_copy2463244161827234": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "garrett.shue@stryker.com",
        "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><br>\nJanet is counting on us</span></span></span><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><br>\n </span></span></span><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"fontsize-2em\">Quality Policy</span></span></span></p>\n<p>At Stryker, quality is first in everything we do. We are driven to make healthcare better for our customers by providing innovative products and services that meet regulatory requirements through our effective quality system.</p>\n",
